> Hi Viresh,
> 
> If up and down the cpus, the system will reports errors.
> I think it has nothing to do with the platform, So could you help analyse
> this case?
> 
> software:
>     Linux 4.4

A lot of development happened after that on the OPP core to making things
better/stable.

> hardware:
>     cluster0: cpu0 cpu1 cpu2 cpu3
>     cluster1: cpu4 cpu5

It would be helpful to look at your DT files to see how are you setting your OPP
bindings.

